#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/rpt-experiment.ipynb:9
msgid "Degradation experiments with reference performance tests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/rpt-experiment.ipynb:20
msgid ""
"When running degradation experiments in the lab, it is important to use "
"reference performance tests (RPTs) to measure capacity and other key "
"metrics, otherwise the experimental contitions will interfere with the "
"measurement! In PyBaMM, you can run simulations with RPTs using the "
"``Experiment`` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/rpt-experiment.ipynb:-1
msgid "[1]:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/rpt-experiment.ipynb:-1
msgid ""
